{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>I will declare to you.</b> The word of the prophet concerns the future. Those who say that these are blessings have erred, because they found at the end \"and he blessed them\" (Genesis 49:28). But where are the blessings of Reuben, Simeon, and Levi? In the manner of prophecy he said, \"And this is what their father declared to them; afterward he blessed them\" — but Scripture did not record the blessings."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:17.223508103Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}